+# Source-bound answer completion
+
+Public conversation answers receive completion proof only from a uniquely owned, linked completed execution and matching durable answer and completion events. Missing evidence preserves the literal answer without proof.
+
+Optional presentation is independently revalidated against that full answer and is published only alongside its completion proof. The bounded event tail can omit proof for older answers.
+
+Later approval, input-wait, reconciliation or superseded events invalidate completion just as failure or partial outcomes do. No UI descriptor grants native authority.
